  ('batulao', 'Mt. Batulao', 'Nasugbu, Batangas',
   'An 811 m grassland peak in Nasugbu, Batangas, popular for day hikes. Two Trails start at the same jump-off and meet at the summit: the New Trail (3.4 km, the usual way up) and the steeper Old Trail (4.2 km) past Camp 1. There is almost no shade and no reliable water, so carry at least 2 to 3 litres.',
   'Bundok na 811 m ang taas sa Nasugbu, Batangas, na puno ng damuhan at patok sa day hike. Dalawang Trail ang nagsisimula sa iisang jump-off at nagtatagpo sa tuktok: ang New Trail (3.4 km, karaniwang inaakyat) at ang mas matarik na Old Trail (4.2 km) na dumadaan sa Camp 1. Halos walang lilim at walang maaasahang tubig, kaya magdala ng 2 hanggang 3 litro.',
